Dear Busisiwe Cele,

Welcome to the November 2026 edition of our monthly newsletter from Cederberg Office Supplies. We appreciate the support of customers like you at Garden Route Guesthouse.

Product news this month includes new stock of recycled printing paper, refillable desk organisers made from reclaimed timber, and a fresh range of filing folders in warm summer colours. We have also restocked ink and toner for the most common small office machines and added a small selection of guest comment cards and breakfast menu holders that guesthouses often find useful.

Seasonal tip: with summer on the way, keep paper and files away from direct sunlight and open windows to prevent curling and fading. A cool, dry cupboard works well for spare stock, and it helps to keep only one ream open at a time during humid weather.

Thank you for reading. If you have suggestions for future news or products you would like us to source, please reply and let us know.

Kind regards
Pieter Malan
Cederberg Office Supplies

